flowchart LR
  U[User question] --> A
  subgraph AG[LangGraph agent - Ollama qwen2.5:7b]
    A[understand] --> B[pick_tables] --> C[write_sql] --> D[validate]
    D -->|ok| E[run]
    D -->|error, 1 retry| C
    E -->|error, 1 retry| C
    E --> F[explain]
  end
  E <-->|MCP over stdio| S
  subgraph SRV[MCP server]
    S[tools: list_tables, describe_table,<br/>get_table_docs, list_metrics, run_query]
    G[Guardrails: sqlglot SELECT-only, schema allow-list,<br/>PII masking, LIMIT 100, 5 s timeout]
    S --> G
  end
  G --> W[(DuckDB, read-only,<br/>no external access)]
  SEM[semantic/: manifest.json + metrics.yml] --> S
  AG -.traces.-> L[Langfuse, self-hosted]
